 "longBusinessSummary": "Makita Corporation engages in the production and sales of electric power tools, pneumatic tools, and gardening and household equipment in Japan, Europe, North America, Asia, Central and South America, Oceania, The Middle East, and Africa. The company offers construction and building tools, such as cordless impact driver, cordless circular saw, cordless belt sander, cordless multi tool, cordless impact wrench, and cordless framing nailer. It also provides gardening tools, including cordless pruning saw, cordless pole hedge trimmer, cordless edger, cordless blower, cordless scarifier, and cordless pole saw. In addition, the company offers cleaning tools, including cordless vacuum sweeper, cordless cleaner, cordless pressure washer, cordless polisher scrubber, as well as cordless cooler & warmer box, cordless job site speaker, and cordless bar light. Further, it provides parts, repairs, and accessories. The company was formerly known as Makita Electric Works, Ltd. and changed its name to Makita Corporation in April 1991. Makita Corporation was founded in 1915 and is headquartered in Anjo, Japan.",
